  "body": "\n## Added\n* Generative AI Service Management\n  * Support for new optional parameter ``--public-access-path-patterns``\n    * ``oci generative-ai hosted-application create --public-access-path-patterns``\n    * ``oci generative-ai hosted-application update --public-access-path-patterns``\n* Product Catalog\n  * Support for the service\n    * ``oci oci-product-catalog``\n* Compute Service\n  * Support for new command\n    * ``oci compute volume-attachment attach-volume-attach-nvme-volume-details``\n  * Support for new accepted value ``nvme`` for ``--type``\n    * ``oci compute volume-attachment attach --type nvme``\n    * ``oci compute instance launch --launch-volume-attachments``\n\n## File Checksums (SHA256)\noci-cli-3.94.2.zip 4bc646a900578c4e1d3ea99da2dda11d17d5245c59b0765cfde62977a56dd4c3\noci-cli-3.94.2-Windows-Server-2016-Offline.zip 1c6bbf4f409ab45c878e104399b46e4cddfec42a874f6adad57b68206b8f99fa\noci-cli-3.94.2-Windows-Server-2019-Offline.zip ed5e1abb1986907d91b0fb2fe6de91f0ef5e67e25053b9c193988995200a07ef\noci-cli-3.94.2-Ubuntu-20.04-Offline.zip 69e1cf37f6a356ec28014e97bc9820fed2fdf3a6a48a9b0ee104a548748c5228\noci-cli-3.94.2-Oracle-Linux-10-Offline.zip f7332642d0c8cc494fbf09cde1965b8e76e62c47e35d9224e6e4f3eb8d1cba8b\noci-cli-3.94.2-Ubuntu-22.04-Offline.zip cdba170522b626d6068b8b96fcc1a925ba16d374e480d720c917d4a30b6d141c\noci-cli-3.94.2-Oracle-Linux-9-Offline.zip af54762f67408f8b624cca9c8878887a747e81bbf1e76f533b125c56938ae1ca\noci-cli-3.94.2-Windows-Server-Installer.msi 5e2a3978ae9e1706ef4f65bf6037919bc9af37533d1d4996b14d88323f509ef8"
